{"id":"frost","lemma":"Frost","pos":"noun","rank":3620,"glosses":["frost; freezing weather (weather conditions below 0 °C)","frost; ice; all the natural phenomena caused by such weather collectively","a sensation of cold, especially due to illness"],"ipa":"/frɔst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/De-Frost.ogg/De-Frost.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Frostes","plural":"Fröste"},"examples":[{"text":"Letzte Nacht gab es Frost.","en":"It frosted last night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755445","words":[{"g":"last"},{"g":"night"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Nächste Woche gibt es vielleicht Frost.","en":"It may freeze next week.","words":[{"g":"near","l":"nah"},{"g":"week"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"perhaps, maybe"},null]},{"text":"Nächste Woche wird es vielleicht Frost geben.","en":"It may freeze next week.","words":[{"g":"near","l":"nah"},{"g":"week"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"perhaps, maybe"},null,{"g":"to give"}]},{"text":"Die Pflanzen wurden durch den Frost geschädigt.","en":"The plants suffered damage from the frost.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to plant"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"by means of"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"damaged"}]},{"text":"Es herrschte Frost!","en":"It was freezing!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/497036","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to rule","l":"herrschen"},null]}]}